    [OntoCorrection Agent | loop_rounds: 3 tool_retries: 1 | themis_test] explicitly declared as ObjectProperty with domain/range axioms: Themis test CQ10 and CQ27 reported Incorrect for Achievement type AchievementType
    [OntoCorrection Agent | loop_rounds: 3 tool_retries: 2 | themis_test] explicitly declared domain and range axioms: Themis tests CQ10 and CQ27 reported Incorrect for Achievement type AchievementType
    [OntoCorrection Agent | loop_rounds: 3 tool_retries: 3 | themis_test] added explicit domain/range axioms: Themis test CQ10/CQ27 reported Incorrect for Achievement type AchievementType</vaem:rationale>
